  <h2>Read the final event guide</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="thinking-card">
    <h3>Saturday open-house guide</h3>
    <p><span class="ex">Staff have to enter through the side door by 8:30. At the entrance, all visitors must show a ticket, but they don’t have to bring a printed copy because a phone screen is fine. Volunteers should send large groups to the east hall first; it usually has more space. Nobody must block the emergency exit. Yesterday, the setup team had to move one information table after the power inspection. Next month, events will have to add a second recycling station.</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="quiz" data-quiz data-success-message="Correct. You separated the current requirement, optional format, recommendation, and past requirement in the event guide.">
    <h3>Reading check: use only the guide</h3>
    <div class="quiz-list">
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="enter through the side door by 8:30" data-hint="The first sentence gives the staff requirement and deadline." data-fix="Staff have to enter through the side door by 8:30."><p class="quiz-question">1. What are staff required to do?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="enter through the side door by 8:30">enter through the side door by 8:30</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="use the east hall after 8:30">use the east hall after 8:30</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="bring two printed tickets">bring two printed tickets</button></div></div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="the ticket can be printed or shown on a phone" data-hint="Don’t have to bring a printed copy removes the print requirement, but visitors still need a ticket." data-fix="The ticket can be printed or shown on a phone."><p class="quiz-question">2. What choice do visitors have?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="the ticket can be printed or shown on a phone">the ticket can be printed or shown on a phone</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="they can enter without any ticket">they can enter without any ticket</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="they must buy a ticket at the door">they must buy a ticket at the door</button></div></div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="send large groups to the east hall first" data-hint="Should introduces the guide’s recommendation for volunteers." data-fix="Volunteers should send large groups to the east hall first."><p class="quiz-question">3. What does the guide recommend?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="send large groups to the east hall first">send large groups to the east hall first</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="close the east hall to every group">close the east hall to every group</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="move all tables next month">move all tables next month</button></div></div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="the power inspection required the move" data-hint="Had to plus yesterday describes a completed past requirement." data-fix="The setup team moved the table because the power inspection required it."><p class="quiz-question">4. Why did the setup team move a table yesterday?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="the power inspection required the move">the power inspection required the move</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="a visitor recommended the move">a visitor recommended the move</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="the team will need the table next month">the team will need the table next month</button></div></div>
